<title>SWEDEN: MOODY'S SAYS HAS POSITVE OUTLOOK FOR SWEDISH BANKS.</title>
<headline>MOODY'S SAYS HAS POSITVE OUTLOOK FOR SWEDISH BANKS.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit ratings agency Moody's said on Monday it had a positive rating outlook for Sweden's banking sector but saw little scope for further consolidation with four major banks dominating the market.</p>
</text>
